The CoM region costs ~6.6% wasted space; load bearing at the paper's default Lambda = 3x maximal
weight costs almost nothing further, as it rarely binds at that capacity. Tightening Lambda makes
it bite (factor 0.15 -> 0.2477 on n=18), so the default is generous rather than the constraint
being inactive.
